Subject: [PATCH 2585/3799] soh: rename func_80ACA76C -> EnOwl_EndKokiriTalk

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: stops the owl fanfare when the Kokiri textbox closes and sends the owl into its takeoff
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
index ab3deb430..57bad79d2 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
@@ -347,7 +347,8 @@ void EnOwl_StartHeadTurn(EnOwl* this) {
     this->unk_407 = this->unk_3F2;
 }
 
-void func_80ACA76C(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80ACA76C: stops the owl fanfare when the Kokiri textbox closes and sends the owl into its takeoff
+void EnOwl_EndKokiriTalk(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
     Player_SetCsActionWithHaltedActors(play, &this->actor, 8);
 
     if (Actor_TextboxIsClosing(&this->actor, play)) {
@@ -381,7 +382,7 @@ void EnOwl_ConfirmKokiriMessage(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
                 break;
             case OWL_OK:
                 Message_ContinueTextbox(play, 0x2067);
-                this->actionFunc = func_80ACA76C;
+                this->actionFunc = EnOwl_EndKokiriTalk;  // was func_80ACA76C [LLM:HIGH]
                 break;
         }
     }
